%% Conceptual design: optional components require deployment-specific validation.
flowchart TB
  U[User question and authenticated identity] --> C[Identify question requirements and permitted data]
  C --> L[Hybrid search: meaning and keywords]
  C --> X[Exact document or identifier lookup]
  C --> S[Calculator when arithmetic is required]
  L --> P[Reconcile permissions and source metadata]
  X --> P
  P --> F[Combine rankings and remove duplicates]
  K[Optional graph relationships: hints, not proof] -.-> P
  F --> R[Optional reranker: score relevant passages]
  R --> E[Evidence ledger: support, sources, and gaps]
  S --> E
  E --> D[Language model drafts from evidence]
  D --> V[Check claims and access before delivery]
  V --> O[Cited answer, qualification, or evidence-gap response]
